      "cooked": "<p>Vs Matriarch in the Time Cataclysm, Surprise Shopping Trip in play, Darken the Sky is drawn.  Madness ensues.</p>\n<p>I could come up with three ways to play this, two of which triggered some sort of infinite damage loop by applying Shopping Trip to each fowl as I pulled it from the trash.  Once I figured that out I focused on the DtS instruction “Put all of the fowl cards from the villain trash into play.” and put them all out at once then dealt 13 x 1 damage.</p>\n<p>Thank God the Scholar had Flesh to Iron and Alchemical Redirection in play!!  But it wiped out two Carrion Fields, the mask and knocked the Matriarch down a nice peg.</p>\n<p>What I’m hoping none of you are going to tell me is that</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:43.880Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
