      "raw": "Vs Matriarch in the Time Cataclysm, Surprise Shopping Trip in play, Darken the Sky is drawn.  Madness ensues. \r\n\r\nI could come up with three ways to play this, two of which triggered some sort of infinite damage loop by applying Shopping Trip to each fowl as I pulled it from the trash.  Once I figured that out I focused on the DtS instruction \"Put all of the fowl cards from the villain trash into play.\" and put them all out at once then dealt 13 x 1 damage.  \r\n\r\nThank God the Scholar had Flesh to Iron and Alchemical Redirection in play!!  But it wiped out two Carrion Fields, the mask and knocked the Matriarch down a nice peg.\r\n\r\nWhat I'm hoping none of you are going to tell me is that",
