      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\"]\n\nSounds like you played it pretty much right; I think you put the fowl into play one at a time, but once they&#39;ve been knocked back out they don&#39;t get a second in.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI disagree, because destroyed cards go to the trash. &nbsp;So if you pulled each fowl out and put it into play individually, it would trigger Shopping, get destroyed, go to the trash and then come back out. &nbsp;That would trigger the infinite loop.\n\nThe only way to avoid that is to follow the &quot;put <em>all </em>Fowl cards&quot; into play but doing it all at once. &nbsp;Then that card is done. &nbsp;Then Shopping Trip deals a one damage attack for each Fowl card that came out.\n",
