    {
      "id": 66485,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-26T06:56:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is the same loop as Darken the Skies &amp; Hairtrigger R<span>eflexes, I believe we're still waiting on an official ruling on that too.</span></p><p><span>The consensus from the players is that Darken the Skies is </span><span>\"Remove all Fowl from the Trash. &nbsp;Put all the removed Fowl into play.\" as two separate instructions, not as the single one written on the card (purely to stop the loops).</span></p><p><span>However, as I said, we are still waiting on an official type ruling on this.</span></p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:44:11.836Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
