      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>This is the same loop as Darken the Skies &amp; Hairtrigger R<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">eflexes, I believe we&#39;re still waiting on an official ruling on that too.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The consensus from the players is that Darken the Skies is </span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&quot;Remove all Fowl from the Trash. &nbsp;Put all the removed Fowl into play.&quot; as two separate instructions, not as the single one written on the card (purely to stop the loops).</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">However, as I said, we are still waiting on an official type ruling on this.</span></p>",
